# Send Inquiry Agent POC

We are replacing the "Send Inquiry" form on the Cenomi Tenant Central sign-in page with a friendly chat agent.
The agent collects the same data as the form, derives what it can from conversation, confirms derived values
with the user, verifies the user (email link, plus an SMS OTP for a mobile), checks that the mandatory documents were uploaded, and submits
the same inquiry payload. Target: about 5 user turns instead of ~25 form inputs.

## Stack
- `frontend/`: React 18, Vite, TypeScript, CSS Modules + CSS variables (no UI framework), `@microsoft/fetch-event-source` for SSE over POST, Vitest + React Testing Library.
- `backend/`: Python 3.11+, FastAPI, Pydantic v2, pydantic-settings, sse-starlette, LangGraph, langchain-openai, python-multipart, slowapi, pytest + httpx. Package manager: `uv`.
- LLM: OpenAI chat model with tool calling, name from `OPENAI_MODEL` env var. Never hard-code a model name.

