- Delivery order: `docs/DELIVERY-PLAN.md` (breadth days in `prompts/breadth/`, then two sprints). During the breadth days, build only what the day prompt lists; the gates come in the sprints.
- Testing: `docs/specs/testing-strategy.md`. Every PR keeps `make ci` green and runs the live layers its §4 requires; the PR's Testing section lists what ran per layer.
